       </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row course-cards\">\n        <div class=\"col-2 course-home-grid large-and-above-only\">  \n          <div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"card-body pr-2\">\n    \n\n<nav class=\"course-nav\" aria-label=\"Course materials\">\n  <ul class=\"w-100 m-auto list-unstyled\">\n    \n      \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<li class=\"course-nav-list-item\">\n  <div class=\"course-nav-parent d-flex flex-direction-row align-items-center justify-content-between\">\n    <span class=\"course-nav-text-wrapper\">\n      \n        <a class=\"text-dark nav-link\"\n          data-uuid=\"a0535005-71d6-6aff-c448-38f8838ab8d1\"\n           href=\"/courses/ids-910-leadership-development-fall-2002/pages/syllabus/\" >\n          Syllabus\n        </a>\n      \n    </span>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <span class=\"medium-and-below-only\"><hr/></span>\n  \n  <ul\n    class=\"course-nav-child-nav m-auto collapse\"\n    id=\"nav-container_desktop_a0535005-71d6-6aff-c448-38f8838ab8d1\"\n    aria-labelledby=\"nav-button_desktop_a0535005-71d6-6aff-c448-38f8838ab8d1\"\n  >\n    \n  </ul>\n</li>\n\n    \n      \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<li class=\"course-nav-list-item\">\n  <div class=\"course-nav-parent d-flex flex-direction-row align-items-center justify-content-between\">\n    <span class=\"course-nav-text-wrapper\">\n      \n        <a class=\"text-dark nav-link\"\n          data-uuid=\"fab5295f-c296-01a9-9d27-7df7bb5967e5\"\n           href=\"/courses/ids-910-leadership-development-fall-2002/pages/calendar/\" >\n          Calendar\n        </a>\n      \n    </span>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <span class=\"medium-and-below-only\"><hr/></span>\n  \n  <ul\n    class=\"course-nav-child-nav m-auto collapse\"\n    id=\"nav-container_desktop_fab5295f-c296-01a9-9d27-7df7bb5967e5\"\n    aria-labelledby=\"nav-button_desktop_fab5295f-c296-01a9-9d27-7df7bb5967e5\"\n  >\n    \n  </ul>\n</li>\n\n    \n      \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<li class=\"course-nav-list-item\">\n  <div class=\"course-nav-parent d-flex flex-direction-row align-items-center justify-content-between\">\n    <span class=\"course-nav-text-wrapper\">\n      \n        <a class=\"text-dark nav-link\"\n          data-uuid=\"1a1d5a86-10c2-40b4-2e20-bb73c8853f6d\"\n           href=\"/courses/ids-910-leadership-development-fall-2002/pages/lecture-notes/\" >\n          Lecture Notes\n        </a>\n      \n    </span>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <span class=\"medium-and-below-only\"><hr/></span>\n  \n  <ul\n    class=\"course-nav-child-nav m-auto collapse\"\n    id=\"nav-container_desktop_1a1d5a86-10c2-40b4-2e20-bb73c8853f6d\"\n    aria-labelledby=\"nav-button_desktop_1a1d5a86-10c2-40b4-2e20-bb73c8853f6d\"\n  >\n    \n  </ul>\n</li>\n\n    \n      \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<li class=\"course-nav-list-item\">\n  <div class=\"course-nav-parent d-flex flex-direction-row align-items-center justify-content-between\">\n    <span class=\"course-nav-text-wrapper\">\n      \n        <a class=\"text-dark nav-link\"\n          data-uuid=\"a49a7019-5f3e-842a-3d32-dfd087074bec\"\n           href=\"/courses/ids-910-leadership-development-fall-2002/pages/assignments/\" >\n          Assignments\n        </a>\n      \n    </span>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <span class=\"medium-and-below-only\"><hr/></span>\n  \n  <ul\n    class=\"course-nav-child-nav m-auto collapse\"\n    id=\"nav-container_desktop_a49a7019-5f3e-842a-3d32-dfd087074bec\"\n    aria-labelledby=\"nav-button_desktop_a49a7019-5f3e-842a-3d32-dfd087074bec\"\n  >\n    \n  </ul>\n</li>\n\n    \n  </ul>\n</nav>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-sm-12 col-lg-10 course-home-grid\">\n          <div class=\"\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between\">\n                <div class=\"p-0 col-lg-9\" id=\"main-course-section\">\n                  <div class=\"card-body\">\n                    \n<div class=\"mb-2\">\n  <header>\n  <div class=\"course-section-title-container\">\n    <div id=\"course-title\">\n      \n      <h2 class=\"pb-1 mb-1\">Syllabus</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n  <article class=\"content pt-3 mt-1\">\n    <main id=\"course-content-section\">\n    <h3 id=\"course-meeting-times\">Course Meeting Times</h3>\n\n<p>Lectures: 3 session at varying intervals, ranging from 3 to 7.5 hours / session</p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"fall-2002-schedule\">Fall 2002 Schedule</h3>\n\n<p>Tuesday, Week 1 &ndash; 10:00-2:00<br>\nSaturday / Sunday, Week 4, 2002 (UNH Outward Bound)<br>\nFriday, Week 11 &ndash; 9:00-1:00 (including alumni panel and lunch)</p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"session-1-leadership-development-for-incoming-tpp-students\">Session 1: Leadership Development for Incoming TPP Students</h3>\n\n<p>10:00: Welcome, Introductions, and Overview</p>\n<p>10:15: Introduction to Core Leadership Capabilities</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Visioning, Analyzing, Relating, Inventing, Enabling</li>\n</ul>\n<p>10:30: Visioning: Constructing a Shared Vision (15 min.)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Application: Shared Vision for Technology Policy Leadership (30 min.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>11:15: Analyzing:Developing a Strategic Plan (15 min.)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Application: &ldquo;Valuable Disconnect&rdquo; Analysis of Technology Policy Leadership Vision (30 min.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>12:15: Analyzing: Understanding &ldquo;The Rules of the Game&rdquo; (15 min.)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Application: the Bargaining Game (60 min.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>1:30: Assignment and Advance Planning for UNH Outward Bound Weekend</p>\n<p>2:00: Adjourn</p>\n\n    <h4 id=\"assignment-1-due-monday-week-2\">Assignment 1 (Due Monday, Week 2)</h4>\n\n<p>Write a 2-3 page paper (double-spaced) in which you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Identify the specific leadership skills you want to develop further during your time as a TPP student - your &ldquo;future vision.&rdquo;</li>\n<li>Explain the rationale for why you have selected these skills.</li>\n<li>Indicate your assessment of where you are at today with respect to these skills - your &ldquo;current reality.&rdquo;</li>\n<li>Spell out an action plan to further develop these skills.</li>\n<li>Establish clear measurable indicators to track progress during this time.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Simplified Example:</em></p>\n<p>Skill: Active Listening.</p>\n<p>Rationale: Technology Policy Leaders have to be able to listen well if they are to lead effectively. Too often, the &ldquo;logic of the technology&rdquo; or the politics of the situation takes over and the listening doesn&rsquo;t take place.</p>\n<p>Assessment: I listen well when I focus on this skill, but most of the time this is not the case. In particular, I don&rsquo;t take enough time to paraphrase back to people what I have heard them say.</p>\n<p>Action Plan: Every morning I will identify one critical conversation likely to happen that day and make a personal commitment to listening effectively.</p>\n<p>Measurables: I will set up a matrix to track progress &ndash; assessing how I am doing on a daily or weekly basis (whichever works best &ndash; I will start with the daily tracking).</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> Anticipate using this paper as a &ldquo;baseline&rdquo; measure, re-examining the paper at various times during the TPP program (especially as a point of reflection towards the end of the program).</p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"session-2-leadership-development-offsite\">Session 2: Leadership Development Offsite</h3>\n\n<p>8:30: Welcome and overview</p>\n<p>8:40: Review of Leadership Skills</p>\n<p>9:00: Relating: Negotiation Skills and Principles</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Interest-Based Bargaining Principles (45 min.)</li>\n<li>Communication Skills for Negotiators (30 min.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>10:15: Relating: Negotiation Skills and Principles (cont.)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Facilitation Skills (30 min.)</li>\n<li>Dealing with Difficult People (30 min.)</li>\n<li>Negotiation Simulation: The Training Conflict (60 min.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>1:00: Inventing: Leadership and innovation (15 min.)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Application: &ldquo;Egg Drop Enterprise&rdquo; - Design and test (90 min.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>3:30: Concluding comments</p>\n<p>4:00: Adjourn</p>\n\n    <h4 id=\"assignment-2-due-monday-week-11\">Assignment 2 (Due Monday, Week 11)</h4>\n\n<p>Write a 2-3 page paper (double-spaced) in which you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Review the specific leadership skills the you highlighted in your first paper and assess lessons learned to date &ndash; in the TPP program and in your interactions outside of the program &ndash; using the metrics you identified.</li>\n<li>Be sure to provide specific examples to illustrate your points.</li>\n</ul>\n\n    <h3 id=\"session-3-leadership-development-calibration\">Session 3: Leadership Development Calibration</h3>\n\n<p>9:00: Welcome and Overview</p>\n<p>9:15: Calibration: Learning Dialogue on Leadership Lessons to Date in TPP</p>\n<p>9:45: Cross-Cultural Negotiations</p>\n<p>11:00: Enabling: Alumni Panel</p>\n<p>1:00 Concluding Comments and Adjourn</p>\n</main>\n  </article>\n</div>\n\n\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                  <button \n  type=\"button\" \n  class=\"btn course-info-button large-and-above-only\"\n  id=\"desktop-course-drawer-button\"\n  data-target=\"#desktop-course-drawer\"\n  data-toggle=\"collapse\"\n  aria-label=\"Course Info\"\n  aria-controls=\"desktop-course-drawer\"\n  aria-expanded=\"false\"\n>\n  <img\n    class=\"expand-drawer-img drawer-icon-img\"\n    src=\"/static_shared/images/left_arrow.3c482a1f6223bff3f0e6.svg\"\n    alt=\"\"\n  />\n  <img\n    class=\"collapse-drawer-img drawer-icon-img\"\n    src=\"/static_shared/images/close_small.b0a2684ccc0da6407a56.svg\"\n    alt=\"\"\n  />\n</button>\n\n<div class=\"collapse border-left p-0 large-and-above-only col-3\" id=\"desktop-course-drawer\">\n    \n\n<div class=\"course-info\">\n  <div class=\"course-detail-title bg-light-gray\">\n    <h2 class=\"font-black py-1 pl-3 m-0\">\n      Course Info\n    </h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"px-3 mt-4\"